{"repositoryId":724174637,"availability":"available","full":"stupideinstein09/ghostty-config","name":"ghostty-config","description":"Configure Ghostty in a full-screen TUI: themes, fonts, window, input, shaders—edits your config live with terminal-matched colors.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Go","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2023-11-27T14:46:47Z","updated":"2026-10-12T19:14:48Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://stupideinstein09.github.io","topics":["aerospace","cachyos","configuration","dotfiles","ink","linux","neovim-configuration","nextjs","svelte","terminal","tiling","tmux","tui","vim","weechat-irc","zsh"],"demo":"https://stupideinstein09.github.io/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T07:37:15.331Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-13T07:37:15.331Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-13T07:37:15.331Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-13T07:37:15.331Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js","Svelte","Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Ghostty is a fast, modern terminal application that many people love. But making it look and work exactly the way you want can be tricky. ghostty-config is a friendly helper tool that takes the hassle out of customizing your Ghostty terminal.","Think of it like a remote control for your terminal's appearance and behavior. Instead of typing confusing commands or editing hidden files, you get a simple, visual way to make changes. You can adjust colors, fonts, window size, and many other settings with just a few clicks.","This application is designed for everyone. Whether you have never customized a terminal before or you're a seasoned user, ghostty-config makes the process simple and enjoyable."],"features":["Visual Theme Picker: Browse and select from many beautiful color schemes. See a live preview of how your terminal will look before you apply the change.","Font Adjustments: Change the font style and size easily. Make text bigger for comfort or smaller to fit more on the screen.","Window Settings: Control the default size of your terminal window. Set it to open in a specific position or size every time.","Cursor Style: Choose how your cursor looks. Pick from block, underline, or beam styles.","Padding Control: Adjust the space around the text inside the terminal window for a cleaner look."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/stupideinstein09/ghostty-config/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"20043169878bc1704eaf3a9bb6d38c2cf64aadbcbb6a9bb6de35ba5429a42af2","extractedAt":"2026-10-13T07:37:15.466Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T07:37:15.466Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Ghostty is a fast, modern terminal application that many people love. But making it look and work exactly the way you want can be tricky. ghostty-config is a friendly helper tool that takes the hassle out of customizing your Ghostty terminal.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/stupideinstein09/ghostty-config/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"This application is designed for everyone. Whether you have never customized a terminal before or you're a seasoned user, ghostty-config makes the process simple and enjoyable.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/stupideinstein09/ghostty-config/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"20043169878bc1704eaf3a9bb6d38c2cf64aadbcbb6a9bb6de35ba5429a42af2","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/stupideinstein09/ghostty-config/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-13T07:37:15.466Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-12T19:14:48Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/stupideinstein09/ghostty-config/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-13T07:37:15.467Z","hash":"20043169878bc1704eaf3a9bb6d38c2cf64aadbcbb6a9bb6de35ba5429a42af2","originalBytes":8341,"storedBytes":8341,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["terminal","application","see","ghostty","download","color","ghostty-config","click","file","settings","make","it.","run","window","backup","change","loo